  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Markets 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Mercados inclusivos 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det allm&#xe4;nna syftet med den andra fasen av det inkluderande marknadsprojektet &#xe4;r att p&#xe5;verka: i) intensifieringen av agroekologiskt jordbruk, ii) medveten anv&#xe4;ndning och konsumtion av resurser och produkter och iii) social integration av den utsatta befolkningen inom agro-livsmedelssystem.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general purpose of the second phase of the inclusive market project will be to influence the i) intensification of agroecological agriculture, ii) conscious use and consumption of resources and products and iii) social inclusion of the vulnerable population within agri-food systems.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general purpose of the second phase of the inclusive market project will be to enhance the i) to  intensification of agroecological agriculture, ii) conscious use and consumption of resources and products and iii) social inclusion of the vulnerable population, of agri-food systems.

This will be done through 6 specific objectives:

- To facilitate access to international and national markets for agri-food products, promoting conscious food consumption.

- To facilitate the access of family productive units to adequate and innovative services, inputs, technology, and capacities for the intensification of agroecological agriculture and the efficient and sustainable use of resources.

- To promote the financial inclusion of men and women through i) access to microcredits and other forms of financing, ii) microinsurance for risk transfer and iii) financial education.

- To strengthen the capability of public and private institutions to support the economic, social, and environmental resilience of the target group

- To strengthen access to resources, services, and opportunities to expand capacities and skills that contribute to the empowerment of women and inclusion 

- To enhance access to information, knowledge and systematized experiences on mechanisms, approaches, tools, methodologies, and others that contribute to advocacy on the issues prioritized by the project.</narrative>
  </description>
